{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1063137/block/singleImage/3263861/df/01M3DS5MY8EMRWZXKPBNB9111S.jpg?updatedAt=1794363709\"/><figcaption>威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>大圍美松苑有保安暈倒。 今日（11日）早上6時53分，大圍美田路25-35號美松苑一名保安員在屋苑閘口暈倒，其同事發現後連忙報警。警方和救援人員接報後到場，發現一名46歲姓陳男保安員陷入昏迷，隨即由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.103455+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:21:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.075362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:10.225496+00:00","content_hash":"3b21d64afce3dc274db0f538ef1dc4dbabe661b175961d42152778d33056710b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.103455+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}